Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only beat I'll go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the edge of my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,heart. If you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,edge of my heart I can't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It still doesn't appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up and head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The peroxide moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just not anything\NI love. The World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there when we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there when we catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it in the middle of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The suspense is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, she's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can leave any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Luffy gets here,\Nwe'll set sail immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Since no one else is saying it, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, there are about as many\Nbattleships out there as there are us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter when we leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,escaping from this place is\Ngoing to be virtually impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a report from the\Nmain island front gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.38,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All personnel of any sloppy have\Nbeen collected and accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We have also identified about 50\Npirates as well as a mutinous giant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,attempting to escape the island through\Nthe front gate here in the northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sambai and the others!\NWhat did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're home free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with thousands of marines\Nafter them, they still won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, this\None time those guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are set with a full\Nbarrage of cannon fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They have been eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All targets are currently presumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In the island's current conditions,\Nthe chances of survival are impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat, the number of\Nsurvivors on any lobby is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a report from Battleship Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The courthouse and the tower of law located\Nin the southeast corner of the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as the underground\Npassage connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the main island to the\Nbridge of hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,have all been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The only remaining target\Nis the Bridge of Hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They killed all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You head straight for the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner that your crew can\Nget back together, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, we'll split into two\Ngroups and bring down the drawbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Franky family and the\Nshipwrights from Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see them, I want you\Nto pass on a message for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oimo! Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yokozuna, I'm sure he\Nwas there right beside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you up for a fight or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about Sodom and Gomorrah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I will follow Big Bro Franky\Nuntil the day I die, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That mortar hit him square in the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep moving no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only ones who can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He talked about it like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they kill people so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To them, it's just a tiny island on a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A place they've been sent to erase\Nfrom the world without any emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.10,0:06:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what a Buster Call is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll save\Nyou no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all going home together, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not die, I won't accept it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gom gom gom! Pistol!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He jumped back so the punch\Nwouldn't hit him as hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My next attack will push CP9's\Nkilling odds to the limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sixth Power is extreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Secret Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Six King Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like those impact dials\Nwe saw back on Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But it feels like these hits\Nare a heck of a lot harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Temperature victory bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Goofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That Lucci guy's strong as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we've got\NStraw had to hold him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he could have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.74,0:08:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He could probably kill all of\Nus if he had half a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange, but I\Nthink Luffy always knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Right from the start, he can\Ntell who he has to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who he has to beat if we're gonna survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The pigeon guy's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the crap out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He has instincts just like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a report, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is in\Nthe first support column.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's still alive, then. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want all ships to take position\Naround the Bridge of Hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna die, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stupid, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The first support column\Nhas now been cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They blew up half the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rob Lucci of CP9 and Straw Hat Luffy\Nare both inside the support column.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The battleships are coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships take up combat positions\Nto run the bridge in hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,On the bridge of the escort ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we've identified nine pirates, including\Nthe pirate hunter Zoro and Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.44,0:10:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe that these are the culprits\Nwho defeated Cape in the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming here to take Robin back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let them try!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't underestimate the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Cape,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.30,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,no one has launched a successful attack on\NEni's lobby in its 800 years of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet this tiny pirate crew wiped them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought Straw Hat was a rookie,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but as we speak he's going\Nhead-to-head with Rob Lucci,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the strongest fighter Cape has ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting Lucci and beating\Nhim are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, their crew is completely\Noutnumbered and totally surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to avenge\Nevery defeat we face today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look guys, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone got to the bridge safe and sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, we're all doing fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We even rescued Robin just\Nlike we said we would!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is beat that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a matter of how long we\Ncan hold off all these damn marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems it's just as you said they\Nall survived I have to admit I'm rather
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,impressed But now I'm going to bring\Nthis little rebellion of yours to an
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,end I will not allow any evil to Prosper\Nin this world Those ranked lieutenant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,commander or below stay put to the\N200 elite Captains and commanders,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,engage the enemy and wipe\Nthem out immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Captains from headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All these guys are in the same class\Nas that smoker guy from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's like a billion of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.18,0:13:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing that proves is\Nthat they're afraid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, where'd Sanji go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was here just a second ago. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The one time I want that stupid\Ncook around and he runs away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All hands prepare to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to show off,\Njust attack already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I could always use some\Nmore heads to bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we\Ncan't give them an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Until Luffy makes it here,\Nwe have to hold our ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get down to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If they damage this ship, we can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them capture me ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy them! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Nico Robin and bring her here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not giving her back after\Nall the trouble we've gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can send me as many\Ncaptains as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can send in my share of captains too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beating one at a time is too much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you all on at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear witness to the\Npower of the Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to fight with guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's left? Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a strong run?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The bad guys are coming, Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here and guard the boat, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to hold them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now thunder, charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Swing arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? The clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that one's my thunderbolt tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's mocking us with\Nthat ridiculous weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lambs of respect, pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry\Nabout protecting me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If the crew is fighting,\Nthen I'm fighting, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to see here, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just hostages!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't find us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luke, you'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that blood pumping technique\Nof yours is losing its edge already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You never stood a chance against the\Nworld government in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Face the facts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if this island\Nis burned to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as that woman is\Nwanted by the world government,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll chase her to the ends\Nof the earth if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the meaning of God's justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be chasing anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.60,0:18:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'm putting an end\Nto this right here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Six king guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman, there's no time for\Nyou to be spacing out, Uso!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No Straw Hats or no ordinary pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're insanely strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.80,0:20:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're holding their\Nown against the captains!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, so that woman has Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone attack on my command, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now see and close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With a flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Thunderbolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll teach you to mess with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess these guys are a bit\Nstronger than your average Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wants their ass kicked next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.84,0:22:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa, I didn't know you were here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I just came here to save\NRobin, that's it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come to see you or\Nyour stupid face, understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.32,0:22:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:22:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cape boss can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, I'm your opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.84,0:23:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mess with Robin,\Nthen you mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.54,0:23:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is between you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill every last one\Nof them and save you for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can watch it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.68,0:23:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come get me, boss kitty cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.30,0:23:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to take you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.94,0:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ngoing to do about it, Hoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.06,0:23:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That pigeon bastard's mine, I'm gonna kick\Nhis ass all over the place! Hey, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him what you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.48,0:24:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop lying around comfy and\Nbleeding like you're about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not the loopy I know at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's filled with\Nsmoke, we can still see the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.14,0:24:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still see the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.18,0:24:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This place isn't hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.26,0:24:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd\Nlet it end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.96,0:24:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop acting like you're about\Nto die, you stupid bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.50,0:24:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to make us worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,GET UP AND FIGHT!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.18,0:25:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.72,0:25:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.96,0:25:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can all leave this place together!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.46,0:25:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you can stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.34,0:25:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.56,0:25:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't drop to the ground ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.44,0:26:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, now life return. Terminate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,annoying farce of yours has gone on long
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,enough i'll crush you with a single blow\Nand end this once and for all oh and don't
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.64,0:26:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,worry about your little friends just as\Nyou wished you all be reunited once again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,very soon once i kill you there next Then
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.72,0:26:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll spend eternity together in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.06,0:26:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloods attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:26:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory! Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.14,0:27:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.60,0:27:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.12,0:27:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.72,0:27:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hit any of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.78,0:27:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.72,0:27:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of the berry berry fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.36,0:27:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's buried. Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all, I can't even move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.42,0:28:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.08,0:28:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, just where do\Nyou think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you like flying around so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.80,0:28:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.72,0:28:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then weapons left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.28,0:28:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.78,0:28:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of these jerks\Nhave Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They could say the same of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.88,0:28:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for train to flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.48,0:28:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to eliminate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.90,0:28:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate the rust rust fruit\Nand became a rust man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.34,0:28:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your swords will never defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.38,0:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, my Ubershiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.78,0:28:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn all your blades\Ninto little piles of rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.00,0:29:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an interesting trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.22,0:29:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't work twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, if you think that's all\NI can do, you're sadly mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! What happened? What can I move?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.28,0:29:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I rusted every\Nsingle joint in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.26,0:29:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's gather rest of you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.36,0:29:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Firebird star!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.88,0:29:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.58,0:29:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, jet pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.18,0:30:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come, jet pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.28,0:30:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for that one again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.88,0:30:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultimate radius, six king gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.76,0:31:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't drop to the ground ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep a close eye on Nicole\NRobin. She'll grow to be
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,More than you can handle, now\NGum-Gum, no, it's over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is the last time you'll see\Nme this is world government
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.68,0:31:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,business people like you\Nshould and stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.60,0:31:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it all for us, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.32,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to sacrifice herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.00,0:31:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.84,0:31:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.62,0:31:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You morons can't challenge the\Nentire world and expect to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.62,0:32:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as that woman is wanted by the\Nworld government, I'll chase her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.22,0:32:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.12,0:32:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.32,0:32:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.32,0:32:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.72,0:33:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.46,0:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.22,0:33:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Down there, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.78,0:33:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention aboard all ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent report!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.92,0:33:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, Rob Lucci,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the most powerful agent of CP9,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.18,0:33:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,was seen lying face down at a\Nlifeless in the first column.
